.TH MYGREP 3 "25 September 2026" "libmyutils v1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search file for lines matching a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <myfilefunctions.h>
.sp
.BI "int mygrep(FILE *" fp ", const char *" search_str ", char ***" matches ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR mygrep ()
function searches the file stream
.I fp
for lines containing
.I search_str
and stores dynamically allocated matching lines into
.I matches
returning the total count of matches.
.SH AUTHOR
Annas Sharif (BSDSF24A008)
